This source context is a thin deployment binding around the official flagship
SGLang Inkling CUDA 13 multi-architecture image at source commit
b7252cc6b0c78b25ecea7ee5efa91a6ae37d0f19 (Apache-2.0).

The model/API flags follow SGLang's official Inkling day-zero tracker. The
GB10 execution flags are adapted from SGLang's physically verified two-Spark
Inkling-Small profile and its dedicated-image source commit a74222ef6e690f851e2e4ff1c0be7dc1357be313:
Triton attention, Marlin FP4/MoE, disabled prefill CUDA graphs, and the
extra-buffer Mamba radix-cache strategy. The flagship TP8 topology is
source-complete but remains Pending until an eight-Spark physical canary
succeeds.
